This means that I find that the evolution of AI technology in health care lies in the transition from informative to behavioral aspects. The result matters but more important is the next step.

@sleepagotchi creates its technology around this point, trying to make users take steps to improve their sleep. By using artificial intelligence for analysis and recommendations, the company tries to combine all these stages in one cycle.

From my point of view, this approach is very relevant because the projects that decrease the distance between insights and action will play a huge role in people's lives in the future. @sleepagotchi

